{"kind":"assert","text":"Direction from Hugh, 26 October 2026, 15:55 ET: steer the journey (plan 032, section 2b) on the basis of the research note notes/2026-10-26-agentic-development-practice-survey.md (request a455fdba, head c81b168d, in review by the checker). Five decisions, recorded in the note's section 6:\n\n1. The rules say who lands. MVP settled choice 4 (\"People decide\") becomes \"the rules say who lands, and the exit test's rules require a person\". H2 is not built as a prohibition on granting change.merge to the agent role; the landing policy's two routes (note 2026-10-16-declared-landing-policy.md, section 4.1) replace it.\n2. A `finding` item joins the change lane: file, range, class, severity, confidence, failure scenario, source with tool or model version, tree; states open, resolved, irrelevant; a merge guard refuses while a required source has an open finding. Data only: a lane revision. The landing policy's assessment becomes a view over findings.\n3. The agent wake is part of J5 (request 8efc61e7), not its \"next step\": one authorized event feed with no webhook, read over J5's Durable Streams side. It lands before the exit test.\n4. File now a design request for the membership version that makes roles data: a trusted-author list and a reviewer-agent whose verdict is recorded apart from approval, under the roles note's rule (never count an agent whose controller controls an author).\n5. The exit test (plan 032, section 2d) measures human approvals per change, time waiting on a person, and reverts; its rules include one tier-0 extent with zero approvals and a person's merge; a revert is recorded as a link kind.\n\nOrder asked of the planner (note section 7): amend plan 032 as draft 3 recording these in section 5; place the finding item at J3's position (after G4, plan 033 row 11) rather than interrupting G4; J5 amended to include the wake; exit-test rules before the exit test. After measuring: the destination version with the two routes, combined with the evidence-rules version so there is one cohort change; the membership roles version; extents as parallel reservations if the numbers ask for it. Unchanged: approval per exact version (carry stays deferred), agent approval never counts as a person's, controller tracing, checks bound to the tree, refusal with a reason, policy as reviewed data.","body":{"to":"planner"}}